{"originalLanguage":"ja","title":"Mr. Music","artist":"れるりり feat. 初音ミクほか","date":"2026-08-14","sourceId":"14693102:022","sourceHash":"74d54880a4242f3e497f0ad922ecbb49f006cf5baea96b385cf5933da95051ed","duration":272.2,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":4.019,"end":8.173,"text":"Hey Mr. Music 強く抱いて","translation":"Hey Mr Music 날 꼭 안아줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":8.175,"end":10.9,"text":"Hey Mr. Music...","translation":"Hey Mr Music","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":29.817,"end":37.664,"text":"この頃じゃ少しだけ心が拗ねている","translation":"요즘은 조금 마음이 토라져 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":37.666,"end":45.07,"text":"熱い思いを閉じ込めて 進めなくなってる","translation":"뜨거운 마음을 가둔 채 앞으로 못 나아가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":45.071,"end":53.209,"text":"あの頃は良かったと振り返ってばかりで","translation":"그때가 좋았다며 돌아보기만 하고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":53.211,"end":61.993,"text":"今日の喜びを探すこと 忘れてしまってる","translation":"오늘의 기쁨을 찾는 걸 잊어버렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":61.995,"end":65.877,"text":"なんとなく日々を重ねればほら","translation":"그저 하루하루를 쌓아 가다 보면 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":65.878,"end":69.872,"text":"ちょっとずつ薄れてゆく本能","translation":"조금씩 희미해져 가는 본능","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":69.873,"end":72.961,"text":"世知辛い 要らない 足りない","translation":"각박해 필요 없어 모자라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":72.962,"end":76.975,"text":"そんな僕じゃつまらない","translation":"그런 난 재미없잖아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":76.976,"end":80.909,"text":"Hey Mr. Music 強く抱いて","translation":"Hey Mr Music 날 꼭 안아줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":80.911,"end":85.206,"text":"Hey Mr. Music 踊らせてよ","translation":"Hey Mr Music 나를 춤추게 해줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":85.207,"end":89.21,"text":"君がくれた温もりで","translation":"네가 준 온기로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":89.211,"end":94.825,"text":"僕を包んで keep on groovin'","translation":"나를 감싸줘 keep on groovin'","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":94.826,"end":98.94,"text":"迷いも戸惑いも","translation":"망설임도 당혹스러움도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":98.941,"end":102.632,"text":"ごまかしたままだから","translation":"그대로 얼버무린 채라서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":102.634,"end":107.2,"text":"胸の中パンクしそうなほど","translation":"가슴속이 터질 것만 같을 만큼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":107.202,"end":111.477,"text":"溜まりに溜まってる","translation":"쌓이고 또 쌓여 가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":111.478,"end":115.481,"text":"なんとなく長いものに巻かれて","translation":"그저 큰물결에 휩쓸리다 보면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":115.482,"end":119.385,"text":"ちょっとずつ磨り減ってく希望も","translation":"조금씩 닳아 가는 희망도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":119.386,"end":122.524,"text":"失くさない 消さない やめない","translation":"잃지 않아 지우지 않아 그만두지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":122.526,"end":126.609,"text":"僕は僕をあきらめない","translation":"난 나를 포기하지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":126.611,"end":130.372,"text":"Hey Mr. Music 時を止めて","translation":"Hey Mr Music 시간을 멈춰줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":130.374,"end":134.548,"text":"Hey Mr. Music 魔法をかけて","translation":"Hey Mr Music 마법을 걸어줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":134.549,"end":138.593,"text":"恋の始まりのように","translation":"사랑의 시작처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":138.594,"end":142.96,"text":"夢を見せて keep on movin'","translation":"꿈을 보여줘 keep on movin'","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":174.021,"end":176.083,"text":"(Hey Mr. Music)","translation":"Hey Mr Music","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":176.084,"end":178.035,"text":"You've given me such a cool buzz","translation":"내게 짜릿한 전율을 줬어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":178.036,"end":179.846,"text":"(Hey Mr. Music)","translation":"Hey Mr Music","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":179.847,"end":181.939,"text":"Livened up my boring days","translation":"지루했던 내 하루를 되살렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":181.94,"end":183.8,"text":"(Hey Mr. Music)","translation":"Hey Mr Music","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":183.801,"end":185.973,"text":"C'mon, show me an even more wonderful world","translation":"더 멋진 세상을 보여줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":185.975,"end":187.835,"text":"(Hey Mr. Music)","translation":"Hey Mr Music","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3